  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 51 plugins and 387 official stars, with npm weekly downloads at 451,964; dataelement/dsh-desktop led growth at +78 while the official repo shipped dsh 0.2.1-alpha.1. However, 13,443 of 17,687 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, giving a health score of 39 — activity, not total count, is the metric to watch.",
    "zh": "过去 <b>8</b> 小时生态新增 <b>51</b> 个插件，官方仓库涨 <b>387</b> 颗星，npm 周下载量 <b>451964</b>；增长榜由 dataelement/dsh-desktop（+<b>78</b>）领跑，官方同时放出 dsh <b>0.2.1-alpha.1</b>。不过 <b>17687</b> 个非 fork 插件里有 <b>13443</b> 个超过 7 天没动静，健康分仅 <b>39</b>，建议持续观察活跃度而非总量。"
